@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white
title BF-05 Breach & Force Majeure Resolution
|Buyer / Seller|
|Arbitrator|
|Inspector|
|System|
|Buyer / Seller|
start
:1. Report breach or claim\nforce majeure;
note right: Or System detects a missed obligation,\ne.g. funding not cured
|System|
:2. Record case and notify\nother party;
note right: No penalty on allegation
|Arbitrator|
:3. Review evidence against\nsigned terms;
if (Inspection needed?) then (yes)
  :4. Request inspection per\nsigned terms;
  |Inspector|
  :5. Inspect and\nsubmit report;
else (no)
endif
|Arbitrator|
|Arbitrator|
:6. Record breaching party\nand evidence used;
|System|
:7. Notify parties, open\n2-business-day contest window;
note right: Penalty, forfeiture and lock wait;\nno-fault refunds run at once
if (Party at fault contests\nwithin window?) then (yes)
  |Buyer / Seller|
  :8. Submit contest\nwith evidence;
  |Inspector|
  :9. Level 1.5 reviews the case;\ndecision is final;
  note right: Not available if the decision\nalready rests on an inspection
else (no)
endif
|System|
:10. Finalize decision and\nexecute remedy;
if (Material breach and\ntermination requested?) then (yes)
  :11. Settle remaining scope\nand close contract;
  :Contract terminated;
  stop
else (no)
  :Contract stays active;
  stop
endif
@enduml
